msgid "Hardware shaders, the outline fix for them, and async shader compile. Triangle on each says more."
msgstr "⟦Hàrdwàré shàdérs, thé öûtlîñé fîx för thém, àñd àsÿñç shàdér çömpîlé. Trîàñglé öñ éàçh sàÿs möré.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

